      "content": "# Obsidian Vault University: Knowledge Gap Register\n\nThis register identifies specific misconceptions, missing prerequisites, or weak practical skills that need resolution during tutoring.\n\n---\n\n| Gap ID | Concept / Topic | Nature of Gap | Impact | Priority | Suggested Lesson | Status |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- | :---: |\n| **GAP-01** | **Federal vs. NY COBRA** | Confusing 20+ worker threshold with NY 1\u201319 small group threshold | High | **HIGH** | [[group-health-insurance-cobra-ny-continuation]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-02** | **NY DBL Medical Bills** | Assuming NY DBL pays hospital bills like Workers' Comp | Critical | **CRITICAL** | [[new-york-disability-benefits-law-dbl]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-03** | **Guaranteed Renewable** | Assuming guaranteed renewable means premiums cannot rise | High | **HIGH** | [[individual-health-policy-provisions-and-renewability]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-04** | **Reinstatement Sickness** | Forgetting the 10-day sickness waiting period | High | **HIGH** | [[mandatory-and-optional-health-provisions]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-05** | **BOE Disabled Owner** | Assuming BOE disability pays owner's compensation | High | **HIGH** | [[disability-income-provisions-riders-business-uses]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-06** | **Medicare Custodial Care** | Assuming Medicare covers long-term nursing home care | Critical | **CRITICAL** | [[government-insurance-plans]] | **OPEN** |\n| **GAP-07** | **Vault Architecture** | Distinguishing `raw/` sources from `wiki/` derived notes | Medium | **MEDIUM** | [[Lesson 01 - The 4-Layer Vault Architecture]] | **IN PROGRESS** |\n",
